<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32826" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκρέω</span></b> , pf. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ερρύηκα</span> (v. infr.) : aor.
		
			Pass.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερρύην</span> in act. sense, <i><span class="en">
			Hp.
			<u>Aph.</u>
			6.27
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Pl.
			<u>R.</u>
			452d
		</span></i>, 
			Dor.
		
		3sg. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ερρύα</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			4.952.3
		</span></i> (Epid.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flow
				out</i> or <i>forth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ δ᾽ αἷμα μέλαν ῥέε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.119
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					112a
				</span></i>
			; of streams, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἐς θάλασσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἔξω</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				149
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of feathers,
				<i>fall off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερρύηκε τὰ πτερά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					104
				</span></i>
			; of hair,<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				518a32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>shed fruit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκρυήσεται ἡ ἐλαία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>De.</u>
					28.40
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>melt</i> or <i>fall away, disappear,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				452d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Thg.</u>
				130e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερρύησαν οἱ τοῦ Θεμιστοκλέους
				λόγοι τῶν Ἑλλήνων</span> they <i>faded from</i> their
				<i>memory,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Them.</u>
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.
			cogn., <i>shed, let fall,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάριν ἐξέρρευσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.374
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
